{"id":"56d1b049a3689d2f","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-thm-forcing-extension.md","title":"Generic Extension Existence","display":"thm-forcing-extension — Generic Extension Existence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-forcing-extension","aliases":["58-thm-forcing-extension"],"display":"thm-forcing-extension — Generic Extension Existence","depends_on":["[[58-df-forcing]]","[[58-df-ctm]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-forcing-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-forcing-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-forcing-extension — Generic Extension Existence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"58-df-forcing\">58-df-forcing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"58-df-ctm\">58-df-ctm</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,\\Gamma,P,R,G\\in V\">\\(M,N,\\Gamma,P,R,G\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcingSetup}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcingSetup}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[G]_P\">\\(M[G]_P\\)</span> is the canonical name-evaluation extension from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"58-df-forcing\">58-df-forcing</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{ForcingSetup}_S(M,\\Gamma,P,R,G)\\to\\exists!N\\in V\\;\\left(N=M[G]_P\\land\\mathrm{CTM}_S(N,\\Gamma)\\land M\\subseteq N\\land G\\in N\\land\\operatorname{Ord}^N=\\operatorname{Ord}^M\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{ForcingSetup}_S(M,\\Gamma,P,R,G)\\to\\exists!N\\in V\\;\\left(N=M[G]_P\\land\\mathrm{CTM}_S(N,\\Gamma)\\land M\\subseteq N\\land G\\in N\\land\\operatorname{Ord}^N=\\operatorname{Ord}^M\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>No c.c.c. hypothesis is needed once an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>-generic filter is given.</li>\n<li>External existence of such a filter is automatic by the usual diagonal construction when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is countable; it is not asserted here for arbitrary <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-forcing]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ctm","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ctm]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M[G]_P$ is the canonical name-evaluation extension from [[58-df-forcing]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,N,\\Gamma,P,R,G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ForcingSetup}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CTM}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"M[G]_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{ForcingSetup}_S(M,\\Gamma,P,R,G)\\to\\exists!N\\in V\\;\\left(N=M[G]_P\\land\\mathrm{CTM}_S(N,\\Gamma)\\land M\\subseteq N\\land G\\in N\\land\\operatorname{Ord}^N=\\operatorname{Ord}^M\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":1030,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4160","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-thm-forcing-extension.md|58-thm-forcing-extension]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["d06ac5a66d69d291","66d43bb76d055059"]}